{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VINCENT'S EPIC ADVENTURE AWAITS YOU!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Map Of Materials</i>, Vincent finds himself stranded on a mysterious island. To escape and return to his old life, he must rely on his skills, his mind - and your courage. Will he make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark ruins, face dangerous creatures, and discover useful items as you uncover the island\u2019s secrets. Each area brings new challenges - from icy winter landscapes to ancient castle ruins and sand labyrinths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/d1af7d2e9f4565f5fd3c7b133678f708.avif?t=1770872630\" width=640 height=356 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IT WON'T BE EASY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game won\u2019t tell you where to go or what to do next. Vincent\u2019s journey depends entirely on your problem-solving skills and player ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/bd2662073a8f2cdb486330059a797ee0.avif?t=1770872630\" width=640 height=640 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/dc472d56cbe04de036adb4fda50139d1.poster.avif?t=1770872630\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/dc472d56cbe04de036adb4fda50139d1.webm?t=1770872630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/dc472d56cbe04de036adb4fda50139d1.mp4?t=1770872630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>